noPhotos

Alias myDstPlus D*+
Alias myDstMinus D*-

Alias myD0 D0
Alias myAntiD0 anti-D0


Particle pbarpSystem 5.5 0.5

Decay pbarpSystem
 1.0 myDstPlus myDstMinus   PHSP;
Enddecay

Decay myDstPlus 
 1.0 myD0 pi+ PHSP;
Enddecay

Decay myD0 
 1.0 K- pi+ pi+ pi- PHSP;
Enddecay


Decay myDstMinus
 1.0 myAntiD0 pi- PHSP;
Enddecay

Decay myAntiD0
 1.0 K_S0 pi0 PHSP;
Enddecay

Decay K_S0
 1.0 pi0 pi0 PHSP;
Enddecay



End

